&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;SumUp builds simple, affordable financial tools that help small businesses get paid, manage their money, and grow. Beyond payments, we offer a number of financial products - including business banking, card products, lending, and invoicing - giving merchants everything they need to manage their payments and finances in one place.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Cards squad &lt;/strong&gt;is a core part of that, owning the systems that power card issuing, lifecycle management, and transaction processing for merchants across Europe. We handle millions of card transactions every day, and we&#39;re now scaling those systems to support new product capabilities while laying the foundations for a more global, resilient platform. That&#39;s why we&#39;re growing the team and looking for a seasoned backend engineer who can take real ownership of complex, high-impact work. If you want to build systems that genuinely matter to small businesses and you&#39;re excited by the technical depth that comes with high-throughput, distributed architecture, this is the role for you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;🎥 Get a feel for our Berlin office &lt;a class=&quot;text-primary underline cursor-pointer&quot; href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9DG64C3moeQ&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-pm-slice=&quot;1 3 []&quot;&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the end-to-end delivery of backend services within the Cards EU domain, including observability, testing, and production support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the technical roadmap by participating in architectural discussions and proposing solutions for complex, distributed systems challenges&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Raise well-scoped pull requests, conduct thorough code reviews, and help maintain high standards of code quality and test coverage across the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with engineers in adjacent squads and with the product manager to shape and refine the squad backlog&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in incident reviews and the on-call rotation, taking accountability for the reliability of the services you build&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply and champion AI tooling to accelerate engineering workflows, and help raise the team&#39;s overall AI literacy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-pm-slice=&quot;1 3 []&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll be great for this role if…&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid, hands-on experience delivering production-ready backend services end-to-end, including testing, monitoring, and maintenance, on a modern cloud-native stack&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Production &lt;strong&gt;experience with Kotlin&lt;/strong&gt; and interest in working with a number of other languages (Java, Golang and Elixir)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of distributed systems, API design, data modelling, and working with relational databases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands on experience in containerisation, orchestration, and CI/CD practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to take an ambiguous product problem, define the technical approach, and lead it through to implementation with minimal guidance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort working across teams and communicating clearly in written and spoken English in a professional setting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Genuine curiosity about the product domain — comfortable applying a backend lens during feature refinement and thinking beyond the code to understand how your work shapes the user experience
&lt;div data-testid=&quot;markdown-response&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;message&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-pm-slice=&quot;1 3 []&quot;&gt;Why you should join SumUp&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🌎 Opportunity to work with SumUppers globally on large-scale fintech products used by millions of businesses worldwide, from our Berlin office. This involves an office-first setup&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🌈 Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion: be part of a workplace that values and promotes diversity, fostering an inclusive environment where everyone&#39;s perspectives are respected and embraced&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🚀 Enrolment onto our Virtual Stock Option programme: you will own a stake in SumUp&#39;s future success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;📚 A dedicated annual L&amp;amp;D budget of €2000 for your individual development, which can be used to attend conferences and/or advance your career through further education&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;💶 A corporate pension scheme where we match up to 20% of your contributions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🏖 Generous time off: enjoy 28 days of paid leave plus public holidays and special leave days&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🏃 Numerous other benefits such as Urban Sports Club subsidy, Kita placement assistance, subsidised office lunches&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🌴 Break4me: 1-month sabbatical after 3 years of service&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🔗 Referral Bonus: earn additional rewards by referring talented individuals to join the SumUp team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;About SumUp&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Be empowered to do more that matters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At SumUp, we&#39;re on a mission to empower small businesses across the globe by providing simple and affordable tools that allow them to thrive. Today, over 4 million businesses in 37 markets rely on SumUp as their financial partner to manage payments, finance and customer relationships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our commitment to small businesses is reflected in &lt;a class=&quot;text-primary underline cursor-pointer&quot; href=&quot;https://youtu.be/9DG64C3moeQ?si=YpcWuBNBTOQPzeLI&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;our diverse team&lt;/a&gt; of over 3,000 SumUppers from over 90 nationalities, united by global collaboration and an innovative mindset. &lt;a class=&quot;text-primary underline cursor-pointer&quot; href=&quot;https://www.sumup.com/careers/culture/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Our core values&lt;/a&gt; lay the foundation for who we are and what we stand for, shaping our work culture and driving our success. We foster inclusivity and a continuous learning culture, providing a safe space for personal and professional growth. Our differences make us unique and strong as we strive to create an environment where everyone belongs and feels supported, no matter how they identify.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SumUp is proud to be an Equal Employment Opportunity employer, actively seeking and embracing diversity in our workforce. We don&#39;t make hiring or employment decisions based on race, colour, religion or religious belief, ethnic or national origin, nationality, sex, gender, gender identity, sexual orientation, disability, age or any other basis protected by applicable laws or prohibited by company policy. Our commitment extends beyond recruitment to creating a safe and respectful workplace where harassment of any form is strictly prohibited. Discover more about our culture and opportunities on our &lt;a class=&quot;text-primary underline cursor-pointer&quot; href=&quot;https://www.sumup.com/careers/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;careers website&lt;/a&gt;, and follow our journey on &lt;a class=&quot;text-primary underline cursor-pointer&quot; href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/sumup/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;text-primary underline cursor-pointer&quot; href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/insidesumup/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a class=&quot;text-primary underline cursor-pointer&quot; href=&quot;https://www.tiktok.com/@insidesumup&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;TikTok&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Application Tip&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We recognise that candidates feel they need to meet 100% of the job criteria in order to apply for a job. Please note that this is only a guide. If you don’t tick every box, it’s ok too because it means you have room to learn and develop your career at SumUp.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h5&gt;We are looking for a Director of Engineering to join the AI Practice Efficiency team.&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;Your mission will be to define and deliver how AI transforms the daily work of healthcare professionals — across intelligent scheduling, automated document processing, smart task management, and AI-assisted patient communication. You will lead teams building AI-powered features across two horizons: augmenting existing practice workflows with intelligent capabilities, and pioneering net-new AI-native products that unlock entirely new value for practitioners and their patients. Working in the tech team at Doctolib means building innovative products and features that improve the daily lives of care teams and patients across Europe.&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;Your responsibilities include but are not limited to:&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;Lead and scale 1 engineering team owning the AI Practice Efficiency scope: manage teams delivering AI features across practice workflows — intelligent scheduling, automated document processing, smart task management, and AI-assisted patient communication. Champion delivers excellence by unblocking teams, setting high execution standards, and accelerating the pace of experimentation and production release, with an initial focus on the Phone assistant, currently one of Doctolib&#39;s most strategic product bets that we need to grow.&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;Define and execute the AI product-engineering strategy: in close partnership with Product, Data Science, and Design, set the technical direction for AI Practice Efficiency — deciding when to build vs. buy, how to evaluate and select foundation models, when to fine-tune, and how to architect for safety, explainability, and regulatory compliance. Balance ambitious AI innovation with pragmatic, high-quality execution.&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;Own responsible AI delivery in a regulated context: ensure AI features are built with appropriate safeguards for a healthcare environment, covering evaluation frameworks, human-in-the-loop design, data privacy (GDPR/HDS), explainability, and bias mitigation. Serve as the engineering voice ensuring our AI products meet the trust bar that healthcare professionals and patients require. Work together with the VP of Engineering of the Domain to set the AI strategy for the domain.&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;Drive cross-domain AI adoption and platform thinking: collaborate with other engineering streams and the broader AI platform teams to ensure shared AI infrastructure, tooling, and evaluation frameworks both benefit from — and contribute to — your teams&#39; work. Champion AI-augmented engineering practices within your own teams as a forcing function for productivity and quality.&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;Who you are&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;Before you read on: if you don&#39;t have the exact profile described below, but you feel this job description matches your skill set, we still encourage you to apply.&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;You&#39;ll be a great fit if you:&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;Have at least 12+ years of engineering experience, with significant time leading managers and senior ICs in fast-paced, high-growth technology environments — and a proven ability to run multiple teams across complex, interdependent scopes without losing clarity on outcomes&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;Have a track record of shipping AI or ML-powered features to real users at scale, with full lifecycle ownership: from problem framing and data requirements through model evaluation, integration, monitoring, and iteration&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;Stay close to the craft: you use AI tools directly, can build working prototypes to pressure-test ideas, and are hands-on with LLM integration, RAG architectures, fine-tuning tradeoffs, evaluation frameworks, and inference constraints — you see prototyping as a leadership tool&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;Bring sharp product instinct for where AI creates genuine clinical value, combined with a clear framework for navigating responsible AI delivery in a regulated, high-trust healthcare context (GDPR/HDS, explainability, human oversight)&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;Are an exceptional people leader: you deliberately adapt your leadership approach based on context, actively mentor other managers, and build environments where engineers grow and AI craftsmanship continuously rises&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;Are fluent in English&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;It would be fantastic if you:&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;Have experience building AI in healthcare, financial services, or another domain where safety, explainability, and auditability are non-negotiable&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;Have shipped AI that touches clinical workflows, medical terminology, or patient-facing communications&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;Have experience building AI products that work across languages and regulatory frameworks&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;Life at Doctolib Tech&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;Our solutions are built on a single fully cloud-native platform that supports web and mobile app interfaces, multiple languages, and is adapted to country and healthcare specialty requirements.&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;Our stack is composed of Rails, TypeScript, Java, Python, Kotlin, Swift, and React Native.&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;We leverage AI ethically across our products to empower patients and health professionals. Discover our AI vision &lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.doctolib.com/ai-careers/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;Want to learn more about our tech culture and environment? Visit the&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.doctolib.com/tech-doctolib/&quot;&gt; Doctolib Tech site&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;What we offer&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;A Deutschlandticket (Germany-wide public transport pass) fully paid for by Doctolib&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;28 vacation days + 1 additional day for each full calendar year of employment (up to a maximum of 30 days)&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;Work from abroad for up to 10 days per year thanks to our flexibility days policy&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;Company health insurance with great supplementary benefits through our partner Allianz&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;Company pension scheme (bAV) through Allianz with an employer subsidy of 40% (15% within the probationary period)&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;The Doctolib Parent Care program, which includes one month additional parental leave and much more&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;Enrollment in Doctolib&#39;s long-term employee value sharing plan called DoctoGrowth&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;Free mental health and coaching services through our partner Moka.care&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;Subsidized sports membership through our partner Urban Sports Club&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;A flexible workplace policy offering both hybrid and office-based mode&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;Alongside healthy snacks and our regular breakfast buffet, we provide a subsidized meal benefit&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;For caregivers and workers with disabilities, a package including an adaptation of the remote policy, extra days off for medical reasons, and psychological support&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;Relocation support in case of international mobility&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;Access to the best AI tools for coding, development and dedicated training&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;We want your experience to be clear, respectful, and transparent. Learn more about our hiring process on our&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.doctolib.com/tech-doctolib/getting-hired/&quot;&gt; candidate experience page&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;Job details&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;Permanent position&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;Full-time&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;Location: Berlin, Germany&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;Hybrid work setup (up to 2 remote days per week)&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;Start date: as soon as possible&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;We welcome everyone&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;At Doctolib, we are committed to improving access to healthcare for everyone. This translates into our recruitment process. We evaluate candidates based solely on qualifications and motivation, without any form of discrimination.&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;The more diverse ideas are heard, the more our product will truly improve healthcare for all. You are welcome to apply to Doctolib, regardless of your gender, religion, age, sexual orientation, ethnicity, or disability.&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;To ensure equal opportunities, we invite you to exclude personal information (e.g., pictures, age) from your applications. If you require any accommodation, please let us know for support during the hiring process.&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;Join us in building the healthcare we all dream of!&lt;/h5&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Großer Markt, perfektes Timing: Deine Verantwortung&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Unterfranken zählt zu den wirtschaftsstärksten Gesundheitsregionen Deutschlands – und zu den Märkten, die Digitalisierung am dringendsten brauchen. Wir bei Doctolib machen diesen Wandel möglich: mit einer KI-gestützten All-in-One-Lösung, die Healthcare Professionals entlastet und Patient:innen bessere Versorgung bringt – Praxis für Praxis.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Als &lt;strong&gt;Account Executive SaaS / B2B (x/f/m)&lt;/strong&gt; führst Du Dein Territory wie ein eigenes Business: von der strategischen Marktbearbeitung bis zum kontinuierlichen Umsatzwachstum. Deine Mission: Ärzt:innen und Praxisteams in Unterfranken für Doctolib zu begeistern, nachhaltiges Umsatzwachstum voranzutreiben und Deine Region zu einem der stärksten Märkte Deutschlands zu entwickeln. Die Chance, die vor uns liegt, ist noch weit größer als das, was wir bisher aufgebaut haben.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deine Aufgaben&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Territory Ownership vom ersten Tag an:&lt;/strong&gt; Du trägst die vollständige Verantwortung für Dein Vertriebsgebiet – von der Marktanalyse über gezielte Akquise bis zum erfolgreichen Abschluss. Du entscheidest, wie Du Deine Energie einsetzt, um maximalen Impact zu erzielen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nachhaltiges Umsatz- und Pipelinewachstum:&lt;/strong&gt; Du verantwortest Deinen Erfolg, Deine Pipeline und Dein Netzwerk in der Region – und Du weißt, wie Du alle drei systematisch aufbaust und konsequent entwickelst.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stärke im Neukundengeschäft:&lt;/strong&gt; Du verstehst, was Ärzt:innen und Praxisteams bewegt – und machst dieses Verständnis zu Deinem stärksten Argument. Du akquirierst zielgerichtet, pitchst mit Überzeugung und bringst Deals konsequent zum Abschluss.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Datengetriebene Vertriebssteuerung:&lt;/strong&gt; Du misst Deine Performance konsequent mit Salesforce, analysierst Deine Kennzahlen, erkennst Muster früh und steuerst gezielt nach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dein Profil&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Wenn Du nicht jeden der folgenden Punkte erfüllst, aber überzeugt bist, dass diese Stelle zu Dir passt – bewirb Dich. Wir freuen uns auf Deine Perspektive!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nachgewiesene Stärke im Field Sales:&lt;/strong&gt; Du bringst Vertriebserfahrung im Außendienst mit – idealerweise im B2B-Umfeld. Die Dynamik komplexer Sales-Zyklen ist Dir vertraut; Entscheider:innen zu überzeugen ist Deine Stärke.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Neukundenakquise mit strategischem Blick:&lt;/strong&gt; Du liebst es, neue Kund:innen zu gewinnen – und Du gehst dabei nicht nach Bauchgefühl vor. Du analysierst, priorisierst und pitchst mit Präzision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Begeisterung für digitale Transformation im Gesundheitswesen:&lt;/strong&gt; Du bist davon überzeugt, dass smarte Technologie den Praxisalltag wirklich verbessern kann – und Du machst diese Überzeugung im Gespräch spürbar. Für Ärzt:innen, für Praxisteams, für den Markt.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kommunikation auf Top-Niveau:&lt;/strong&gt; Du drückst Dich sehr gut mündlich und schriftlich auf Deutsch (C1-Niveau oder höher) aus; Deine Englischkenntnisse sind außerdem mindestens auf Konversationsniveau (B1).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Präsenz dort, wo es zählt:&lt;/strong&gt; Du weißt, dass der größte Impact im direkten Kontakt entsteht – bei Ärzt:innen, in Praxen, in der Region. Ein Wohnort in Unterfranken (oder die Bereitschaft, umzuziehen), &lt;strong&gt;Reisebereitschaft&lt;/strong&gt; innerhalb Deines Vertriebsgebiets sowie ein &lt;strong&gt;Führerschein Klasse B&lt;/strong&gt; sind daher Voraussetzung.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Was wir Dir bieten&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Die Teilnahme an unserem langfristigen Mitarbeiterbeteiligungsprogramm DoctoGrowth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Einen Firmenwagen mit Tankkarte – natürlich auch privat nutzbar&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Erstklassige Fort- und Weiterbildungsangebote – maßgeschneidert auf Dich und Deine Karriereziele&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eine betriebliche Krankenzusatzversicherung mit individuellen Leistungen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Einen überdurchschnittlichen Arbeitgeberzuschuss zur betrieblichen Altersvorsorge (bAV) von 40 %&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ein gefördertes Sportangebot mit unserem Partner Urban Sports Club&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unser Doctolib Parent Care Programm&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Individuelle Angebote für pflegende Betreuungspersonen und Beschäftigte mit Behinderungen – darunter flexiblere Arbeitszeiten, zusätzliche Freistellung aus medizinischen Gründen und psychologische Unterstützung&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Kostenlose und vertrauliche Mental Health- und Coaching-Sessions über unseren externen Partner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;So sieht unser Interviewprozess aus&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interview mit Talent Acquisition (Video Call – ca. 45 Minuten)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interview mit der/dem Regional Manager:in (Video Call – ca. 1 Stunde)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;DoctoDay (vor Ort in einem unserer Offices - ca. 1,5 Stunden): verbringe Zeit mit Deinem zukünftigen Team und erhalte einen praxisnahen Einblick in die Aufgaben eines Account Executives bei Doctolib&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eine Referenzprüfung&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unser Angebot an Dich&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Details&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unbefristete Festanstellung&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vollzeit (40h / Woche)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Außendienst in der Region Unterfranken&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Startdatum: so schnell wie möglich&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Wir verfolgen die Vision, die Gesundheit aller zu verbessern. Dies spiegelt sich auch im Recruiting wider. Wir evaluieren Bewerbungen ausschließlich auf der Grundlage von Qualifikation und Motivation. Diskriminierung wird bei uns nicht toleriert.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Je diverser unser Team und die Ideen sind, desto mehr wird unser Produkt die Gesundheit unserer Nutzer:innen verbessern können. Deshalb laden wir Dich ein, Dich bei uns zu bewerben – unabhängig von Geschlecht, Religion, Alter, sexueller Orientierung, ethnischer Herkunft oder Behinderung.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Um Chancengleichheit zu gewährleisten, kannst Du in Deiner Bewerbung auf Angaben wie Fotos, Alter, etc. verzichten. Lass uns bitte wissen, welche Vorkehrungen wir treffen können, um Dich bestmöglich zu unterstützen. Wir freuen uns, mit Dir das Gesundheitswesen zu digitalisieren!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Alle bereitgestellten Informationen werden von Doctolib für das Bewerbungsmanagement verarbeitet. Für Details zur Datenverarbeitung klicke bitte&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://doctolib.legal/B2C-Privacy-Policy-Career-DE&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;hier&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Bei Fragen oder wenn Du Deine Rechte wahrnehmen möchtest, wende Dich bitte an hr.dataprivacy(at)doctolib.com.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At IONOS, the leading European provider of cloud infrastructure, cloud services and hosting services, you will work together with a wide range of teams. We are characterized by open structures, a friendly working culture and flat hierarchies with a strong team spirit. We firmly believe that work and fun are compatible, and offer you the right environment for this. Our constant growth means that we are always looking for new colleagues. Become part of IONOS and grow with us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Our &lt;strong&gt;DNS squad&lt;/strong&gt; runs the naming, addressing and time services the rest of the internet quietly assumes will always be there: authoritative and recursive DNS, DHCP, forward proxy and NTP, together with the IP address management that ties them together. Our authoritative platform serves roughly &lt;strong&gt;20 million zones&lt;/strong&gt; from &lt;strong&gt;12 anycast locations&lt;/strong&gt; across &lt;strong&gt;two autonomous systems&lt;/strong&gt;. Our DNS/DHCP/IPAM management system, &lt;strong&gt;DIM, is open source&lt;/strong&gt; (github.com/ionos-core/dim) - what we build here, others run too.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Tasks&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate, harden and evolve our authoritative and recursive DNS, DHCP, forward-proxy, DNS and IP Management (DIM) and NTP services so they stay boringly reliable at internet scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Automate everything that should be automated - infrastructure as code in Puppet, reviewed and version-controlled - and remove the toil that does not need a human.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Instrument and measure: build the metrics, dashboards and signals that tell us what our services are actually doing, because we cannot improve what we cannot see.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive root-cause analysis and lasting fixes through structured ITIL Incident, Problem, Risk and Change management - we make our work and our challenges transparent on purpose.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take part in the team&#39;s &lt;strong&gt;on-call rotation&lt;/strong&gt; for this KRITIS/NIS2 infrastructure (your turn comes up roughly once a month - mandatory and separately compensated) and use what you learn on-call to make the next on-call quieter.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Qualifications&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tools of the Trade&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work with the protocol implementations and the tooling we use to deliver these services and keep them stable:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DNS / DHCP / proxy / time:&lt;/strong&gt; PowerDNS (authoritative, recursor, dnsdist), ISC DHCP (experience with or appetite for Kea is welcome), Squid, chrony.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform &amp;amp; automation:&lt;/strong&gt; Enterprise Linux 9, Puppet (GitOps), BIRD, rsyslog, collectd.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Languages:&lt;/strong&gt; Python, Go, Java, Bash — plus the classic unix toolbelt (awk, sed, git) that still does more than people expect.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data:&lt;/strong&gt; ClickHouse, MariaDB, PostgreSQL.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You do not need to have mastered all of these on day one. You do need to be the kind of engineer who is comfortable reaching for the right one and going deep when it matters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We care less about a perfect CV than about how you think. We work by a few principles, and we mean them:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&quot;If you can&#39;t measure it, you can&#39;t improve it.&quot;&lt;/strong&gt; We make data-driven decisions and monitor continuously.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&quot;Do it once, do it right.&quot;&lt;/strong&gt; Quality and attention to detail matter to us - shortcuts come back as incidents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&quot;Perfection is achieved not when there is nothing more to add, but when there is nothing left to take away.&quot;&lt;/strong&gt; We strive for simplicity and efficiency in every solution; the best fix is often the one that deletes complexity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We appreciate candidates who:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have operated DNS, DHCP or comparable network services in production, ideally at scale and under real reliability obligations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Read RFCs for fun, debug with packet captures, and are not satisfied by &quot;it works again&quot; without knowing &lt;em&gt;why&lt;/em&gt; it broke.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Automate by default and treat configuration as code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring radical candor - say the uncomfortable thing early, in service of the work, not the ego.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Think in terms of blast radius. We use AI-assisted tooling in our development and test workflow, but production changes are always human-gated - risk awareness is a feature, not a brake.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have ever caused (or narrowly avoided) an interesting outage and learned something durable from it, tell us about it. That is operational experience, not a red flag.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Benefits&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid working model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours through trust-based working hours.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At some locations a subsidized canteen and various free drinks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Modern office space with very good transport connections.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Various employee discounts for activities and products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee events such as summer and winter parties, as well as workshops.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Numerous training and development opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Various health offers, such as sports and health courses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;About IONOS&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;content-paragraph&quot;&gt;IONOS is the leading European digitalization partner for small and medium-sized businesses (SMB). The company serves around six million customers and operates across 18 markets in Europe and North America, with its services being accessible worldwide. With its Web Presence &amp;amp; Productivity portfolio, IONOS acts as a &#39;one-stop shop&#39; for all digitalization needs: from domains and web hosting to classic website builders and do-it-yourself solutions, from e-commerce to online marketing tools. In addition, the company offers Cloud Solutions to enterprises who are looking to move to the cloud as their businesses evolve.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;content-paragraph&quot;&gt;We value diversity and welcome all applications - regardless of,&amp;nbsp;for example, gender, nationality, ethnic&amp;nbsp;or&amp;nbsp;social origin, religion, disability, age as well as sexual orientation and identity, physical characteristics, marital status or any other irrelevant factor subject to applicable law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At IONOS, the leading European provider of cloud infrastructure, cloud services and hosting services, you will work together with a wide range of teams. We are characterized by open structures, a friendly working culture and flat hierarchies with a strong team spirit. We firmly believe that work and fun are compatible, and offer you the right environment for this. Our constant growth means that we are always looking for new colleagues. Become part of IONOS and grow with us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Tasks&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You lead and develop a software engineering team of approximately 15 engineers building our Website Builder Application – driving roadmap delivery, technical excellence and team performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are accountable for the architectural direction, code quality, reliability and continuous evolution of the Website Builder Application in close collaboration with Product Management and stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You educate, coach and grow your engineers, set clear goals and create an environment in which people do their best work and continuously develop.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You drive our “AI first” initiative within your team and embed AI methods and tools deeply into daily engineering and product work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You design and run continuous learning, training and enablement formats so every team member builds AI fluency and applies it confidently in their day-to-day.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You collaborate closely with Product Management, Design, other engineering teams and stakeholders to shape priorities, unblock delivery and create business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;As a secondary responsibility, you act as the on-site representative for our Cologne development office and take care of selected operational and organizational topics around office, culture and employee experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Qualifications&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Several years of experience leading software engineering teams of 15+ people, ideally in web applications, SaaS or website builder products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical background in modern web technologies, distributed systems and agile delivery – credible and impactful with senior engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of shipping high-quality web or SaaS products at scale and continuously improving engineering practices, quality and velocity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with AI and GenAI tools and a clear vision for how AI changes engineering and product workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong people leadership skills: hiring, coaching, performance management and the ability to build a strong, inclusive team culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on mentality and ownership combined with the ability to balance technical depth with strategic thinking and clear prioritization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong verbal and written German skills &lt;/strong&gt;(English is a big plus), and willingness to take on light operational site-representative duties for the Cologne office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Benefits&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid working model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours through trust-based working hours.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At some locations a subsidized canteen and various free drinks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Modern office space with very good transport connections.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Various employee discounts for activities and products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee events such as summer and winter parties, as well as workshops.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Numerous training and development opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Various health offers, such as sports and health courses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;About IONOS&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;content-paragraph&quot;&gt;IONOS is the leading European digitalization partner for small and medium-sized businesses (SMB). The company serves around six million customers and operates across 18 markets in Europe and North America, with its services being accessible worldwide. With its Web Presence &amp;amp; Productivity portfolio, IONOS acts as a &#39;one-stop shop&#39; for all digitalization needs: from domains and web hosting to classic website builders and do-it-yourself solutions, from e-commerce to online marketing tools. In addition, the company offers Cloud Solutions to enterprises who are looking to move to the cloud as their businesses evolve.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;content-paragraph&quot;&gt;We value diversity and welcome all applications - regardless of,&amp;nbsp;for example, gender, nationality, ethnic&amp;nbsp;or&amp;nbsp;social origin, religion, disability, age as well as sexual orientation and identity, physical characteristics, marital status or any other irrelevant factor subject to applicable law.&lt;/p&gt;
