&lt;li&gt;Identify growth opportunities through customer insights, market research, competitive analysis, and data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive mobile-first thinking across the organization and advocate for exceptional user experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish clear product goals, success metrics, and KPIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Leadership &amp;amp; Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, mentor, and develop a team of Product Managers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster a culture of ownership, experimentation, customer-centricity, and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support career development, coaching, and performance management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish effective product management practices, frameworks, and ways of working.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Delivery&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Engineering Managers, UX Designers, Data Analysts, and other stakeholders to deliver impactful solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prioritize initiatives based on customer value, business impact, and technical feasibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive execution from discovery through delivery and optimization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure high-quality releases and continuous product improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer &amp;amp; Data Focus&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deeply understand customer needs, behaviors, and pain points.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use quantitative and qualitative insights to inform decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive experimentation through A/B testing and iterative product development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor product performance and continuously optimize key metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Align cross-functional teams around product priorities and strategic initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate product strategy, roadmap, and outcomes to senior leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence decision-making through strong business and customer insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
