&lt;li data-start=&quot;1236&quot; data-end=&quot;1348&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1238&quot; data-end=&quot;1348&quot;&gt;Write efficient, well-tested code in C++ and Python&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1236&quot; data-end=&quot;1348&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1238&quot; data-end=&quot;1348&quot;&gt;Develop low-latency, high-bandwidth processing pipelines for airborne imaging sensors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1236&quot; data-end=&quot;1348&quot;&gt;Jump into and understand large codebases.&lt;/li&gt;
