&lt;li data-start=&quot;1236&quot; data-end=&quot;1348&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1238&quot; data-end=&quot;1348&quot;&gt;Perform board bring-up, bootloader customization, and root filesystem generation.&lt;/p&gt;
